<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">All<sp/>commands<sp/>below<sp/>run<sp/>from<sp/>the<sp/>workspace<sp/>root<sp/>(`toolbox-ws/`).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Build<sp/>&amp;<sp/>run<sp/>(native_sim)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>samples<sp/>are<sp/>self-contained<sp/>applications<sp/>and<sp/>add<sp/>this<sp/>repository<sp/>as<sp/>a</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">module<sp/>themselves.<sp/>On<sp/>a<sp/>64-bit<sp/>host<sp/>without<sp/>32-bit<sp/>multilib<sp/>(e.g.<sp/>aarch64),</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">use<sp/>`native_sim/native/64`<sp/>in<sp/>place<sp/>of<sp/>`native_sim`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```sh</highlight></codeline>
